# No Push Notifications

**This project does not implement push notifications.**

## Important Notes

- **No push notification service**: The application does not include any push notification functionality
- **No notification permissions**: Do not request notification permissions from users
- **No service worker notifications**: The service worker ([public/sw.js](mdc:public/sw.js)) does not handle push notifications
- **No notification API usage**: Avoid using the Notification API or any push notification libraries

## Alternative Communication Methods

Instead of push notifications, this project uses:

- **Real-time updates**: WebSocket connections via [server/services/websocketService.js](mdc:server/services/websocketService.js)
- **Live dashboard updates**: Real-time data synchronization for member dashboard
- **PWA capabilities**: Progressive Web App features without push notifications
- **In-app notifications**: Status indicators and real-time UI updates

## Development Guidelines

- **Do not implement push notifications**: Any requests to add push notification features should be declined
- **Focus on real-time features**: Use WebSocket connections for live updates
- **PWA without notifications**: Maintain PWA functionality without push notification capabilities
- **User experience**: Ensure the app provides value without requiring push notifications

## Related Files

- [public/sw.js](mdc:public/sw.js) - Service worker (no push notification handling)
- [public/manifest.json](mdc:public/manifest.json) - PWA manifest (no notification permissions)
- [server/services/websocketService.js](mdc:server/services/websocketService.js) - Real-time communication
- [client/services/pwaService.js](mdc:client/services/pwaService.js) - PWA service (no notifications)

Remember: This is a Poetry Slam members area focused on real-time competition updates, not push notifications.